          <div class="venue"><span class="pill">Co-first author</span></div>
          <h3>Improving Robustness of Tabular Retrieval via Representational Stability</h3>
          <dl class="steps">
            <div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>The same table written as CSV, HTML or Markdown can get different search results.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Idea</dt><dd>A small adapter pulls every format toward one shared representation.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Result</dt><dd>Table search gives more consistent results across formats.</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="side">
          <div class="facts">
            <div class="fact">
